    {
      "id": "MJUe",
      "code_hash": "6b0fd66d05665f655568e8431b554884",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"a-modelling-session-on-lpspec\">A modelling session on lpspec</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In lpspec the model is a document: a YAML file that says what the variables,\nconstraints and objective <em>are</em>. Nothing below is a builder. Edit the file in\nthe cell that holds it and every cell that reads it re-runs: the math is\ntypeset again, the file is checked again, and the solve runs again on the\ndata you have given it.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Three things to try, in order:</span>\n<ol>\n<li>In the model, add a cap on emissions under <code>constraints:</code> \u2014\n   <code>carbon: {dims: [], expression: emissions &lt;= 40}</code> \u2014 and watch the math,\n   the dispatch and the prices change: biomass, dearer than gas but clean, comes\n   on. The named expression <code>emissions</code> is already declared, so no new data\n   is needed.</li>\n<li>Break something on purpose, such as <code>sum(p, over=snapshto)</code>, and read the\n   error: it names what is wrong and what to write instead.</li>\n<li>Edit the cost of gas in the data table, then move the sliders under the\n   pathway further down.</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "5937b7a1dae58f1911fadcf3bb0db21f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-0' random-id='50699231-bf6b-7d7f-8970-85e50aef93c4'><marimo-code-editor data-initial-value='&quot;description: &#92;&quot;least-cost dispatch: four generators meet a load over one day&#92;&quot;&#92;nversion: 0&#92;n&#92;ndimensions:&#92;n  snapshot: {dtype: int, description: hours of the day}&#92;n  generator: {dtype: str, description: generating units}&#92;n&#92;nparameters:&#92;n  p_max: {dims: [generator], description: &#92;&quot;capacity, in MW&#92;&quot;}&#92;n  cost: {dims: [generator], description: variable cost per MWh}&#92;n  rate: {dims: [generator], description: tonnes of CO2 per MWh}&#92;n  avail: {dims: [snapshot, generator], description: &#92;&quot;capacity factor, between 0 and 1&#92;&quot;}&#92;n  load: {dims: [snapshot], description: &#92;&quot;demand, in MW&#92;&quot;}&#92;n&#92;nvariables:&#92;n  p: {dims: [snapshot, generator], bounds: {lower: 0}, description: output}&#92;n&#92;nexpressions:&#92;n  emissions: sum(rate * p)&#92;n&#92;nconstraints:&#92;n  capacity:&#92;n    dims: [snapshot, generator]&#92;n    expression: p &#92;u003c= p_max * avail&#92;n  balance:&#92;n    dims: [snapshot]&#92;n    expression: sum(p, over=generator) == load&#92;n&#92;nobjective:&#92;n  sense: minimize&#92;n  expression: sum(cost * p)&#92;n&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eThe model. Edit it.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-language='&quot;yaml&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-min-height='520' data-show-copy-button='true' data-debounce='false'></marimo-code-editor></marimo-ui-element>"
          }
        }
      ],
