            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"a-pathway-the-same-idea-one-period-at-a-time\">A pathway: the same idea, one period at a time</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>models/pathway.yaml</code> is one investment period. <code>solve_over</code> runs it once per\nyear and hands each year's standing capacity to the next as its <code>existing</code>\nfleet, which is the <code>carry=</code>. The two sliders change the data; the model\ndoes not change.</span></span>"
